#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:2
msgid "Security logs"
msgstr "安全日志"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:4
msgid ""
"Security logs allow you to audit what has happened recently in your "
"organization or account. This feature is quite important for many security "
"compliance programs, as well as the general peace of mind of knowing what is"
" happening on your account. We store the IP address and the browser used on "
"each event, so that you can confirm this access was from the intended "
"person."
msgstr ""
"安全日志让你能审计组织或账户近期发生的事情。此功能对许多安全合规项目以及\"知道账户上正在发生什么\"带来的安心感都非常重要。我们存储每个事件的 IP "
"地址和所用浏览器，以便你确认该访问来自预期人员。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:10
msgid ""
"Security logs are only visible to organization owners. You can invite other "
"team members as owners."
msgstr "安全日志仅对组织所有者可见。你可邀请其他团队成员成为所有者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:15
msgid ":doc:`/legal/security-policy`"
msgstr ":doc:`/legal/security-policy`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:16
msgid ""
"General information and reference about how security is handled on Read the "
"Docs."
msgstr "关于 Read the Docs 如何处理安全问题的总体信息与参考。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:19
msgid "User security log"
msgstr "用户安全日志"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:21
msgid ""
"We store a user security log for the latest 90 days of activity. This log is"
" useful to validate that no unauthorized events have occurred."
msgstr "我们存储最近 90 天活动的用户安全日志。该日志有助于验证未发生未授权事件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:24
msgid "The security log tracks the following events:"
msgstr "安全日志跟踪以下事件："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:26
msgid "Authentication on the dashboard."
msgstr "仪表盘上的认证。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:27
msgid "Authentication on documentation pages (:doc:`/commercial/index` only)."
msgstr "文档页面上的认证（仅 :doc:`/commercial/index` ）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:28
msgid "When invitations to manage a project are sent, accepted, revoked or declined."
msgstr "项目管理邀请的发送、接受、撤销或拒绝。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:30
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:50
msgid "Authentication failures and successes are both tracked."
msgstr "认证失败与成功都会被跟踪。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:32
msgid ""
"Logs are available in :menuselection:`<Username dropdown> --> Settings --> "
"Security log`."
msgstr "日志可在 :menuselection:`<Username dropdown> --> Settings --> Security log` 中查看。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:35
msgid "Organization security log"
msgstr "组织安全日志"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/admonition-rtd-business.rst:2
msgid ""
"This feature is only available on `Read the Docs Business "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_."
msgstr "此功能仅在 `Read the Docs Business <https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_ 上提供。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:39
msgid ""
"The length of log storage varies with your plan, check our `pricing page "
"<https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`__ for more details. Your "
"organization security log is a great place to check periodically to ensure "
"there hasn't been unauthorized access to your organization."
msgstr ""
"日志存储时长随套餐而异，详情请查看我们的 `pricing page "
"<https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`__ 。组织安全日志是定期检查的好地方，可确保组织未遭未授权访问。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:43
msgid "Organization logs track the following events:"
msgstr "组织日志跟踪以下事件："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:45
msgid "Authentication on documentation pages from your organization."
msgstr "来自你组织的用户在文档页面上的认证。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:46
msgid ""
"User accesses a documentation page from your organization (**Enterprise "
"plans only**)."
msgstr "用户访问你组织的文档页面（**仅企业版套餐** ）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:47
msgid ""
"User accesses a documentation's downloadable formats (**Enterprise plans "
"only**)."
msgstr "用户访问文档的可下载格式（**仅企业版套餐** ）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:48
msgid "Invitations to organization teams are sent, revoked or accepted."
msgstr "组织团队邀请的发送、撤销或接受。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:52
msgid ""
"Logs are available in :menuselection:`<Username dropdown> --> Organizations "
"--> <Organization name> --> Settings --> Security log`."
msgstr ""
"日志可在 :menuselection:`<Username dropdown> --> Organizations --> <Organization"
" name> --> Settings --> Security log` 中查看。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:54
msgid ""
"If you have any additional information that you wished the security log was "
"capturing, you can always reach out to :doc:`/support`."
msgstr "若你希望安全日志记录某些额外信息，可随时联系 :doc:`/support` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:59
msgid ":doc:`/security`"
msgstr ":doc:`/security`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/security-log.rst:60
msgid ""
"Security information related to our own platform, personal data treatment, "
"and how to report a security issue."
msgstr "与我们自身平台、个人数据处理以及如何报告安全问题相关的安全信息。"

